<h2>Keys</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>G</b> go to an address, or just type a hostname</li>
<li><b>S</b> search the web</li>
<li><b>TAB</b> next link, <b>Shift-TAB</b> previous, <b>1-9</b> jump to a link</li>
<li><b>ENTER</b> follow the selected link, <b>L</b> list every link</li>
<li><b>B</b> back, <b>F</b> forward, <b>R</b> reload, <b>H</b> this page</li>
<li><b>SPACE</b> page down, arrows and PgUp/PgDn scroll</li>
